0111/zions-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e.bin","sha256":"7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e"}},{"id":"73e0b30ba479d9d385ab41fac96df126099019877e84749eb2a99f224479a327","quote":"Average interest-earning assets increased $788 million, or 1%, compared with the prior year period. This was driven by a $1.4 billion increase in average loans and leases, partially offset by a $708 million decline in average investment securities.","context":"Interest-earning Assets","section":"RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":108,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000109380-26-000111","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0000109380","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/109380/000010938026000111/zions-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e.bin","sha256":"7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e"}},{"id":"a2cfdc792c6fba5bb647ef85371081bd577a5743f5ffa76ff6818af5a6208324","quote":"Average loans and leases increased $1.4 billion, or 2%, to $61.9 billion, primarily due to growth in average commercial loans.","context":"Average interest-earning assets increased $788 million, or 1%, compared with the prior year period. This was driven by a $1.4 billion increase in average loans and leases, partially offset by a $708 million decline in average investment securities.","section":"RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":109,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000109380-26-000111","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0000109380","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/109380/000010938026000111/zions-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e.bin","sha256":"7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e"}},{"id":"c0364ebf0d1ee91a1bff00e2c492e1ec5fec4722e933151b8962ceb56a6caa5f","quote":"Average investment securities decreased $708 million, or 4%, to $17.7 billion, primarily due to principal reductions, net of reinvestments. The ongoing runoff of lower-yielding securities improved the earning asset mix and was a meaningful contributor to year-over-year net interest margin expansion.","context":"Average loans and leases increased $1.4 billion, or 2%, to $61.9 billion, primarily due to growth in average commercial loans.","section":"RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":110,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000109380-26-000111","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0000109380","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/109380/000010938026000111/zions-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e.bin","sha256":"7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e"}},{"id":"bdb03f9c1154c243a1e3b45eec9ac0c5ab6526a8aa64ba395314ca2fcaddf1a3","quote":"Average interest-bearing liabilities decreased $2.1 billion, or 4%, from the prior year quarter, reflecting lower average borrowed funds, partially offset by increases in average long-term debt and interest-bearing deposits.","context":"Interest-bearing Liabilities","section":"RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":112,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000109380-26-000111","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0000109380","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/109380/000010938026000111/zions-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661c76e5c64762d855e7493645bc426a20f74e.bin","sha256":"7b9430aad4143c6cf796bc125f661